title: Agent Context Graph — Process Map (P0-P6)
---
flowchart LR
    P0["P0: Trigger<br/>Cron / Event / Manual"]
    P1["P1: Context Assembly<br/>Query all memory layers"]
    P2["P2: Plan Generation<br/>Engine proposes actions"]
    P3["P3: Validation & Gating<br/>Schema + approval checks"]
    P4["P4: Execution<br/>Tool Broker runs actions"]
    P5["P5: Trace Emission<br/>DecisionTrace persisted"]
    P6["P6: Graph Decomposition<br/>Trace → nodes + edges"]

    P0 --> P1 --> P2 --> P3 --> P4 --> P5 --> P6
    P6 -.->|"Feeds next run"| P1

    GRAPH[("Context Graph<br/>Store")]
    P1 <-->|"Read"| GRAPH
    P6 -->|"Write"| GRAPH

    class P0 source
    class P1,P6 graphLayer
    class P2,P3,P4 exec
    class P5 governance
    class GRAPH memory

